From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:49:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] fix: migrate issue live updates to websocket pubsub base

Use the pub/sub broker introduced by the WebSocket notification subsystem for issue timeline invalidations, keep the permission-aware issue WebSocket endpoint explicit, and render the issue description before generating snapshots so the first timeline entry is not replaced by empty content.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
